stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> InReview: Submit exact head
    InReview --> ChangesRequested: Reviewer decision
    InReview --> Approved: Approve exact hash
    InReview --> Draft: Edit creates new revision
    ChangesRequested --> Draft: Edit creates new revision
    Approved --> Draft: Edit cancels pending dependent schedules
    Draft --> Draft: Edit creates new revision
    Draft --> Cancelled: Cancel
    InReview --> Cancelled: Cancel
    ChangesRequested --> Cancelled: Cancel
    Approved --> Cancelled: Cancel
    Cancelled --> [*]
    state "In Review" as InReview
    state "Changes Requested" as ChangesRequested
